      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1656200312,
      "version": 611,
      "versionNonce": 528920952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784394880571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. `Here are our baseline thresholds and this cycle's load test results. Give me an overview of how the cycle looks.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n2. `Which transactions breached their baselines? List every breach with the metric that failed.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n3. `Focus on checkout_submit. How bad is it relative to baseline, and what does the p95 vs avg gap suggest?`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n4. `payment_authorize passed on average but breached p95. Explain what that pattern usually means in a load test.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n5. `Rank all breaches by business risk, considering the priority column in the baseline file.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n6. `Draft a summary of these results for the QA team — technical audience, bullet form.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n7. `Now rewrite that summary for the release manager — non-technical, five sentences max.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n8. `What would you recommend we investigate first before the go/no-go call, and why?`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n9. `If we had to ship anyway, what monitoring would you put in place for the first 48 hours?`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n10. `Turn the release manager summary into a short email I can send, subject line included.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n11. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. `Here are our baseline thresholds and this cycle's load test results. Give me an overview of how the cycle looks.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n2. `Which transactions breached their baselines? List every breach with the metric that failed.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n3. `Focus on checkout_submit. How bad is it relative to baseline, and what does the p95 vs avg gap suggest?`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n4. `payment_authorize passed on average but breached p95. Explain what that pattern usually means in a load test.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n5. `Rank all breaches by business risk, considering the priority column in the baseline file.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n6. `Draft a summary of these results for the QA team — technical audience, bullet form.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n7. `Now rewrite that summary for the release manager — non-technical, five sentences max.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n8. `What would you recommend we investigate first before the go/no-go call, and why?`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n9. `If we had to ship anyway, what monitoring would you put in place for the first 48 hours?`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n10. `Turn the release manager summary into a short email I can send, subject line included.`\nAI : <><><><><><><><>\n\n11. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
