    },
    {
      "id": "gKU2bQD174X1OJkQKJGSE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2279.7271501411687,
      "y": 1944.2110479998655,
      "width": 624.119140625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 295996168,
      "version": 870,
      "versionNonce": 1850951032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784394887629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "You are a senior performance engineer reviewing a release candidate.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "You are a senior performance engineer reviewing a release candidate.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sBGOJKkPLXcx9DETE_AtM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2212.2471696724187,
      "y": 1988.8248040289063,
      "width": 796.2794189453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 822315384,
      "version": 869,
      "versionNonce": 1203492472,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784394887629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Attached are two CSVs: baseline thresholds per transaction, and this cycle's load test\nresults. Transactions marked business_critical in the baseline file matter most.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Attached are two CSVs: baseline thresholds per transaction, and this cycle's load test results. Transactions marked business_critical in the baseline file matter most.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XwlJqtV8KJ2GvhivIHmGK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2224.2635076666306,
      "y": 2055.742849783458,
      "width": 760.659423828125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2045635080,
      "version": 935,
      "versionNonce": 1743406968,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784394887629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Task: compare each transaction's results against its baseline thresholds (avg, p95,\nand error rate). Flag every breach.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Task: compare each transaction's results against its baseline thresholds (avg, p95, and error rate). Flag every breach.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DEdnzxSgJ8HalmxAKfvWV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2208.103473486943,
      "y": 2125.5610879147716,
      "width": 792.9794921875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1405327992,
      "version": 934,
      "versionNonce": 992123000,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784394887629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Format: a table — transaction, metric breached, baseline, actual, % delta, verdict\n(PASS/FAIL), severity (CRITICAL for business_critical breaches, MAJOR otherwise).\nAfter the table, a two-sentence summary a release manager could read aloud in a\ngo/no-go call.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Format: a table — transaction, metric breached, baseline, actual, % delta, verdict (PASS/FAIL), severity (CRITICAL for business_critical breaches, MAJOR otherwise). After the table, a two-sentence summary a release manager could read aloud in a go/no-go call.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P42E_x55p1zbzNcg5DHLO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2493.712987545967,
      "y": 2235.74258441113,
      "width": 123.41986083984375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1874028808,
      "version": 942,
      "versionNonce": 86559096,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784394887629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example row:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example row:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gWPblLLPkodP5ecca6LPT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2218.8631569185254,
      "y": 2270.5665026008396,
      "width": 613.6195068359375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
